
# Max Equal Sum in 3 Stacks

**Difficulty:** Medium  
**Platform:** GeeksforGeeks  
**Topics:** Greedy, Stack, Three Pointers


## 1. Brute Force Solution — Hash Set

```python
class Solution:
    def maxEqualSum(self, s1: list[int], s2: list[int], s3: list[int]) -> int:
        sums1 = set()
        sums2 = set()
        sums3 = set()

        total = sum(s1)
        sums1.add(total)

        for num in s1:
            total -= num
            sums1.add(total)

        total = sum(s2)
        sums2.add(total)

        for num in s2:
            total -= num
            sums2.add(total)

        total = sum(s3)
        sums3.add(total)

        for num in s3:
            total -= num
            sums3.add(total)

        return max(sums1 & sums2 & sums3)
```

**Time Complexity:** O(n1 + n2 + n3) Average  
**Space Complexity:** O(n1 + n2 + n3)

